{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/80bf976562481d0e03a7336a56051afc.avif?t=1768058252\" width=1419 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde8 Bomb-Defusal Duels</strong><br>Cut the wires using your items or trust only your instincts.<br>Safe or deadly? Every round plays out differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/8a6fb72ce420e0cd6eee48618a76b925.poster.avif?t=1768058252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/8a6fb72ce420e0cd6eee48618a76b925.webm?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/8a6fb72ce420e0cd6eee48618a76b925.mp4?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Focus &amp; \u2764\ufe0f Vitality System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Every cut reduces your focus. Once it\u2019s gone, you can\u2019t use items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vitality:</strong> A deadly wire reduces your health. If it reaches zero, you lose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/1243f61db67445929c6ec39f1fd31219.poster.avif?t=1768058252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/1243f61db67445929c6ec39f1fd31219.webm?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/1243f61db67445929c6ec39f1fd31219.mp4?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Earnings &amp; Risk</strong><br>Earn <strong>money</strong> with every successful cut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/477b65aa4238def0efd1eb0e83df90de.poster.avif?t=1768058252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/477b65aa4238def0efd1eb0e83df90de.webm?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/477b65aa4238def0efd1eb0e83df90de.mp4?t=1768058252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Mind Games &amp; Items</strong><br>Set your strategy and strike at the right moment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Spark</strong> \u2013 Disables your opponent\u2019s item use and ends your turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Injector</strong> \u2013 Restores your focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vitality Injector</strong> \u2013 Restores your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safe Wire</strong> \u2013 Marks one safe wire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End Turn</strong> \u2013 Ends your turn early, passing the bomb to your opponent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999240/extras/f248c92a79381c7221b7c0917c354797.poster.avif?t=1768058252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta